{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38151","headline":"余自刑部员外郎爲权所挤值盘石出镇藩屏朝选宾佐以余充职掌记郁郁不乐因成长句寄所知 · 韩偓","name":"余自刑部员外郎爲权所挤值盘石出镇藩屏朝选宾佐以余充职掌记郁郁不乐因成长句寄所知","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正叨清级忽从戎，况与燕台事不同。\n开口谩劳矜道在，抚膺唯合哭途穷。\n操心未省趋浮俗，点额尤慙自至公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38151.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38151","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}